WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.771
When Zann arrived at the swamp, Darb was waiting. So was Gliss.

2
00:00:04.772 --> 00:00:09.354
Zann was still mad at Gliss. But he tried not to let those feelings show.

3
00:00:09.355 --> 00:00:13.547
After today he might not see his friends for a long time.

4
00:00:13.548 --> 00:00:16.227
In fact, he might never see them again.

5
00:00:16.228 --> 00:00:18.647
He didn't want to leave on bad terms.

6
00:00:18.648 --> 00:00:21.973
Gliss smiled uncertainly. "Hi, Zann."

7
00:00:21.974 --> 00:00:27.139
"Hi, Gliss." Zann smiled back briefly. Then he turned toward Darb.

8
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:31.477
"I need a favor. Can you watch Zing for a few hours?"

9
00:00:31.478 --> 00:00:34.557
"Sure," Darb said. "Why? What's up?"

10
00:00:34.558 --> 00:00:43.975
"Right before the trouble with Morb started, I told Professor Nurt I'd do some extra credit work for Food and Drink Creation class," Zann said.

11
00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:47.572
"I need to finish it before school starts tomorrow."

12
00:00:47.573 --> 00:00:52.896
Gliss looked surprised. "I doubt Professor Nurt will care about that," she said.

13
00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:55.633
"Everyone knows you've been kind of busy."

14
00:00:55.634 --> 00:01:02.349
Zann forced a laugh. "I know. But I still want to do it."

15
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:07.106
"Wow." Darb grinned. "Saving Magica must have changed you, Zann.

16
00:01:07.107 --> 00:01:10.398
You never cared that much about schoolwork before."

17
00:01:10.399 --> 00:01:16.086
"Ha-ha, very funny." Zann was nervous. Were his friends suspicious?

18
00:01:16.087 --> 00:01:19.008
Maybe he should have thought of a different cover story.

19
00:01:19.009 --> 00:01:25.399
"Anyway, it will be easier to create puffberry soufflés without Zing there trying to eat them."

20
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:30.245
"No problem." Darb gave Zing a pat. "We'll have fun. Right, buddy?"

21
00:01:30.246 --> 00:01:33.567
Usually Zing loved spending time with Darb.

22
00:01:33.568 --> 00:01:38.237
But today he ignored him, staying pressed against Zann's leg.

23
00:01:38.238 --> 00:01:41.166
"What's wrong with him?" Gliss wondered.

24
00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:45.543
"Nothing." Zann gave Zing a nudge. "Go with Darb, boy."

25
00:01:45.544 --> 00:01:49.027
The dragon whined and emitted a puff of smoke.

26
00:01:49.028 --> 00:01:53.339
Zing refused to leave Zann's side even when Darb called him.

27
00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:57.418
Finally Zann snapped his fingers and created a dragon harness.

28
00:01:57.419 --> 00:02:02.620
He slipped it onto Zing's scaly body and then handed the leash to Darb.

29
00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:05.219
"I'm sure he'll be fine once I'm gone.

30
00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:09.694
He's just annoyed because he knows he'll be missing all those soufflés."

31
00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:16.579
Darb chuckled. "You're probably right." But he looked concerned as he glanced at Zing.

32
00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:20.768
Zann didn't want to give his friends the chance to ask any more questions.

33
00:02:20.769 --> 00:02:27.268
"Thanks," he said. "See you in a few hours." He zapped home.

34
00:02:27.269 --> 00:02:32.477
Soon he was stepping out of his room with his backpack strapped onto his shoulders.

35
00:02:32.478 --> 00:02:36.178
He reached into his pocket to make sure the message stone was there.

36
00:02:36.179 --> 00:02:42.004
As he touched its cool, hard surface, he shivered. What was he getting himself into?

37
00:02:42.005 --> 00:02:44.277
But he couldn't lose his nerve now.

38
00:02:44.278 --> 00:02:49.131
After taking one last look around the house, Zann hurried outside.

39
00:02:49.132 --> 00:02:53.134
He'd already decided to walk to the wormhole instead of zapping there.

40
00:02:53.135 --> 00:02:58.229
It wasn't far, and he would need all his energy for navigating the vortex.

41
00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:06.568
Just as he reached the clearing, the wormhole let out a magical burp that rattled the branches of nearby trees and made Zann jump.

42
00:03:06.569 --> 00:03:09.192
Could he really do this? "Yes,"

43
00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:13.085
he whispered. "I have to do it." Taking

44
00:03:13.086 --> 00:03:16.988
a deep breath, Zann stepped toward the wormhole. Its

45
00:03:16.989 --> 00:03:23.689
ragged mouth opened wider, and its chaotic energy reached out and began to suck him in. "Zann!"

46
00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:29.343
someone shouted. It was Perda, and she sounded angry. "You

47
00:03:29.344 --> 00:03:33.277
didn't think you really tricked me with that pathetic story, did you?" Zann

48
00:03:33.278 --> 00:03:38.204
tried to pull away from the wormhole. But its pull was too strong. "Perda,

49
00:03:38.205 --> 00:03:41.886
no! You have to get back!" "No

50
00:03:41.887 --> 00:03:48.347
way." Perda rubbed her fingers together with one hand while she grabbed Zann's wrist with the other. A

51
00:03:48.348 --> 00:03:53.773
second later a glowing band of energy appeared, linking their wrists together. "A

52
00:03:53.774 --> 00:03:58.492
Shackle spell?" Zann blurted out. "Where'd you learn to do that?" "I'm

53
00:03:58.493 --> 00:04:07.785
full of surprises." She smirked, tugging at the magical shackles to test them. "Now you can't leave me behind!" Zann

54
00:04:07.786 --> 00:04:12.596
gritted his teeth, trying again to escape the wormhole's pull. But

55
00:04:12.597 --> 00:04:17.073
it was no use. It was all he could do to stay where he was. He

56
00:04:17.074 --> 00:04:21.515
had to convince Perda to back off before she got sucked in too! "Listen,"

57
00:04:21.516 --> 00:04:26.014
he said. "I didn't want to lie to you, but—" "Then

58
00:04:26.015 --> 00:04:28.865
why did you?" she shot back. "Perda,

59
00:04:28.866 --> 00:04:33.468
I—" Before he could go on, Gliss burst into view. "Oh

60
00:04:33.469 --> 00:04:37.094
no!" she cried as she saw the wormhole. "What

61
00:04:37.095 --> 00:04:40.709
are you two doing? Are you crazy?" Zann

62
00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:45.362
glared at Perda. "Did you tell everyone I was here?" "I

63
00:04:45.363 --> 00:04:50.008
didn't tell anyone," Perda said. "I don't know what she's doing here." "I

64
00:04:50.009 --> 00:04:57.025
zapped to your house, Zann." Gliss took a step closer while keeping a wary eye on the wormhole. "I

65
00:04:57.026 --> 00:05:02.383
wanted to talk to you. I saw you rushing off down the street, so I followed. Now

66
00:05:02.384 --> 00:05:08.293
I'm glad I did. You can't do this—it's way too dangerous!" "Too

67
00:05:08.294 --> 00:05:12.890
late," Perda said. "We're going, and you can't stop us!" Gliss

68
00:05:12.891 --> 00:05:23.483
frowned. "Oh yeah?" She stepped forward and grabbed Perda's free arm, trying to drag her back. "Don't be stupid!" "Get

69
00:05:23.484 --> 00:05:27.546
back!" Zann was still struggling to hold his position. "The

70
00:05:27.547 --> 00:05:32.637
wormhole's energy is too strong. You'll get sucked in with us!" Just

71
00:05:32.638 --> 00:05:36.298
then he heard a familiar whistle. Zing! The

72
00:05:36.299 --> 00:05:42.924
dragon flew at Zann with a blast of irritated flame. His harness was trailing behind him. "Zing,

73
00:05:42.925 --> 00:05:48.093
no!" Perda exclaimed, ducking her head to avoid the fire. "Zing!

74
00:05:48.094 --> 00:05:52.604
Where are you going?" Darb called, rushing into sight. He

75
00:05:52.605 --> 00:05:55.413
gasped when he saw what was happening. "Hurry!"

76
00:05:55.414 --> 00:06:01.143
Gliss called to Darb. "Help me pull Zann and Perda out!" Darb

77
00:06:01.144 --> 00:06:08.566
jumped forward, grabbing onto Gliss. At the same time, Zing latched onto Zann's backpack with his claws. Zann

78
00:06:08.567 --> 00:06:12.466
felt the wormhole's hold on him loosen slightly. "Fine,

79
00:06:12.467 --> 00:06:17.895
I give up!" Zann called. "Everyone pull back together, and—" Whoosh

80
00:06:17.896 --> 00:06:29.127
! Energy suddenly expanded and contracted, sucking the whole group into the wormhole's gaping mouth.

